            <h3>How to use this deck</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Treat the methods as complementary controls.</li>
              <li>Select tools through your organization's approval process.</li>
              <li>Validate legal, privacy and accessibility obligations for the use case.</li>
              <li>Keep human accountability for high-impact decisions.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="note" style="margin-top: 18px;">Real-world examples are simplified for learning. They illustrate control lessons and do not imply that one test alone would have prevented an incident.</p>
